orizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Krailos\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"116\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Krailos_ac36c1.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.90<br/>December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Krailos Steppe</b> is the surface area of <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a> around the Village. It's inhabited mostly by Ogres and <a href=\"#/wiki/Clomp\">Clomps</a>, though the small underwater cave and the southern mountain that lead to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Mines\">Krailos Mines</a> are also considered part of this area. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hunting_notes\">Hunting notes</span></h2>\n<p>The steppe is a high-risk, low-reward hunting ground for any vocation below level 80; and it is a near-death experience for mages below 100. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Brute\">Ogre Brute</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Savage\">Ogre Savage</a>'s strong physical attacks and magical abilities make them dangerous, and it can be difficult to fight even one at a time. Even though they drop valuable items, the chance of a sudden death in a combo attack is high, and the profit would be spent on <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessings\">Blessings</a>.\n</p><p>The low numbers in Tibia's kill statistics show that the steppe draws little interest.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<p>Ogres are the apex predators in the Krailos Steppe, but <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirates\">Pirates</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Corym\">Pirats</a> occasionally raid the island from the north and east, and seize control of a small area or settlement.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Surface (regular)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"m